// From the law, read in the Journal officiel of 30 April 1963 (annex to Law 63-145):
//   length 1.5 times the height; green half against the pole, white half outside
//   star radius H/8, entirely on the white, two points on the short median and one on
//     the long median; so its center is H/8 x cos 36 past the median, 34.0451
//   crescent outer radius H/4 centered on the flag, inner radius H/5
//   crescent tips bound a large arc of 5/6 of the outer circle, which makes the offset
//     10 cos 30 - sqrt(8^2 - 5^2) = 2.41525 (derived here, not stated in the law)
// The law defines color only on Rood's contrast diagram (recorded as `reference`).
// From elsewhere: hex, Pantone and CMYK are the Album des Pavillons 2023, as FOTW
// reports it. The Album itself wasn't read. White is plain white.
vexyl 1
meta {
  name "Algeria"
  encoder "Naomi Persephone Amethyst"
  license "CC-BY-SA-4.0"
  render-license "CC0-1.0"
  source "https://archive.gazettes.africa/archive/dz/1963/dz-government-gazette-dated-1963-04-30-no-26.pdf"
  source "https://www.crwflags.com/fotw/flags/dz.html"
  source "https://www.upgrowth.dz/reference/decret-executif-n-22-249-du-30-juin-2022-fixant-les-conditions-d-exercice-de-l"
  note "The law gives color only as wavelength and position on Rood's contrast diagram, with no unit, so the hex, Pantone and CMYK values come from the Album des Pavillons 2023, as reported by FOTW."
  note "Algeria's foreign ministry describes Executive Decree 22-249 as amending this law, but that decree, as reproduced by UpGrowth, regulates who may manufacture the flag and doesn't change the design."
  law "Law No. 63-145 of 25 April 1963 defining the characteristics of the Algerian national emblem" {
    source "https://archive.gazettes.africa/archive/dz/1963/dz-government-gazette-dated-1963-04-30-no-26.pdf"
  }
}
palette {
  green "#007a33" {
    pantone "356 C"
    cmyk 88 26 100 12
    reference "Rood's contrast diagram" "wavelength 5.411, position 600 on the normal spectrum"
  }
  white "#ffffff"
  red "#c8102e" {
    pantone "186 C"
    cmyk 14 100 79 4
    reference "Rood's contrast diagram" "wavelength 6.562, position 285 on the normal spectrum"
  }
}
proportion hoist=40 fly=60

bars green white {
  along hoist
}
charge crescent red {
  radius 10
  inner 8
  offset 2.41525
  at center
}
charge star red {
  radius 5
  rotate 90
  at fly=34.0451 hoist=20
}
